1. Downward API -> https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/inject-data-application/environment-variable-expose-pod-information/

env:
- name: NODE_NAME
  valueFrom:
    fieldRef:
      fieldPath: spec.nodeName
2. Run a command on a container
  - name: mc-pod-2
    image: busybox:1
    command:
    - sh
    - -c
    - |
      while true; do
        date >> /var/log/shared/date.log
        sleep 1
      done
3. shared volume for multicontainer pods

- name: shared-volume 
  emptyDir: {}
